canMakeChange() is checked before slot.dispenseOne() is called. What concretely goes wrong if those two lines are swapped?,Nothing - the customer gets their item either way,"The item is already gone when the change check fails, so the machine would have to throw ChangeUnavailableException after physically handing over a product it cannot make change for",The change reserve would go negative but the customer is unaffected,The slot count would be wrong but the money would be right,,2,Order is the point of this method. Everything that can still be refused cleanly is checked first

